.TH "Docv::Unicode" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Unicode \- Display width of characters and grapheme clusters, and interning of multi\-codepoint clusters so a \fB\%Cell\fR stays a plain value.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBmodule Docv::Unicode\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Display width of characters and grapheme clusters, and interning of
multi\-codepoint clusters so a \fB\%Cell\fR stays a plain value.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBWIDE\fR
.RS
.PP
