.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.cluster(id : Int32) : String\fR
Returns the cluster interned as \fIid\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.cluster_id(cluster : String) : Int32\fR
Returns the interning id of a multi\-codepoint cluster (\fB\%0\fR is unused).
.TP 4
\fBdef self.text_width(text : String) : Int32\fR
Columns taken by \fItext\fR, summed per grapheme cluster.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.truncate(text : String, width : Int32) : String\fR
The start of \fItext\fR that fits in \fIwidth\fR columns, ending in \fB\%\[u2026]\fR when
cut.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.width(char : Char) : Int32\fR
Columns taken by a single codepoint: 0, 1 or 2.
.TP 4
\fBdef self.width(cluster : String) : Int32\fR
Columns taken by a grapheme cluster.
